#, no-wrap
msgid "We did not develop a specific program for this mission. However, you can develop your own programs if you think it would be useful."
msgstr "No desarrollamos un programa específico para esta misión. Sin embargo, puedes desarrollar tus propios programas si crees que sería útil."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/2_Recharge1.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below is a program that has been developed by our engineers. It allows you to recharge the <a object|power>power cell</a> of a bot: it goes to the closest <a object|station>power station</a>, waits 5 seconds, and comes back to the initial position."
msgstr "A continuación se muestra un programa desarrollado por nuestros ingenieros. Te permite recargar la <a object|power>celda de energía</a> de un bot: va a la <a object|station>estación de energía</a> más cercana, espera 5 segundos y regresa a la posición inicial."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/2_Recharge1.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remark: If you click on an element of the program underlined in blue, your SatCom will display a text that explains this element. The texts that follow a double slash <code>//</code> are not part of the program, but are comments that help you to understand the program."
msgstr "Nota: Si haces clic en un elemento del programa subrayado en azul, tu SatCom mostrará un texto que explica este elemento. Los textos que siguen a una doble barra <code>//</code> no son parte del programa, sino comentarios que te ayudan a entender el programa."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/2_Recharge1.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Recharge1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>point</a>  start;          // variable for initial pos.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;           // info. about power station\n"
"\t\n"
"\tstart = position;      // store initial position\n"
"\t\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>); // look for station\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);   // go to the power station\n"
"\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(5);               // wait 5 seconds\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(start);           // go back to initial pos.\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Recharge1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>point</a>  start;          // variable para pos. inicial\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;           // información sobre estación\n"
"\t\n"
"\tstart = position;      // guardar posición inicial\n"
"\t\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>); // buscar estación\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);   // ir a la estación de energía\n"
"\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(5);               // esperar 5 segundos\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(start);           // volver a pos. inicial\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/3_Recharge2.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have improved the recharge program. When it arrives at the <a object|station>power station</a>, the bot does not wait exactly 5 seconds, but only until the <a object|power>power cell</a> is fully charged. After the bot is back at the initial position, it displays a message on the screen."
msgstr "Hemos mejorado el programa de recarga. Cuando llega a la <a object|station>estación de energía</a>, el bot no espera exactamente 5 segundos, sino solo hasta que la <a object|power>celda de energía</a> esté completamente cargada. Después de que el bot regresa a la posición inicial, muestra un mensaje en la pantalla."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/3_Recharge2.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Recharge2()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>point</a>  start;          // variable for initial pos.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;           // info. about power station\n"
"\t\n"
"\tstart = position;      // store initial position\n"
"\t\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>); // look for station\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);   // go to the power station\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( <a cbot|object>energyCell.energyLevel</a> < 1 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);           // wait until recharged\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(start);           // go back to initial pos.\n"
"\t<a cbot|message>message</a>(\"Recharge completed\");\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Recharge2()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>point</a>  start;          // variable para pos. inicial\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;           // información sobre estación\n"
"\t\n"
"\tstart = position;      // guardar posición inicial\n"
"\t\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>); // buscar estación\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);   // ir a la estación de energía\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( <a cbot|object>energyCell.energyLevel</a> < 1 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);           // esperar hasta recargar\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(start);           // volver a pos. inicial\n"
"\t<a cbot|message>message</a>(\"Recarga completada\");\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/4_CollectTitanium1.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below is one of the programs that has been developed by our engineers.\n"
"It instructs a <a object|botgr>grabber</a> to retrieve the nearest chunk of <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a> and place it on the <a object|convert>converter</a>."
msgstr ""
"A continuación se muestra uno de los programas desarrollados por nuestros ingenieros.\n"
"Instruye a un <a object|botgr>bot agarrador</a> a recuperar el trozo más cercano de <a object|titanore>mineral de titanio</a> y colocarlo en el <a object|convert>convertidor</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/4_CollectTitanium1.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to execute this program, select the program <code>CollectTitanium1</code> in the list of the programs available on the bot (on the lower left-hand corner of your screen), and click on the arrow symbol <button 21/>. At any moment you can stop the program and take over at the controls with the stop button <button 8/>."
msgstr "Para ejecutar este programa, selecciona el programa <code>CollectTitanium1</code> en la lista de programas disponibles en el bot (en la esquina inferior izquierda de tu pantalla), y haz clic en el símbolo de flecha <button 21/>. En cualquier momento puedes detener el programa y tomar el control con el botón de detener <button 8/>."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/4_CollectTitanium1.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::CollectTitanium1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// 1) Variable definition.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a>  item;            // info. about objects\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 2) Go to the titanium ore and grab it.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>TitaniumOre</a>);// look for titanium ore\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // go to the position\n"
"\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // grab the titanium\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 3) Go to the converter and drop it.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Converter</a>); // look for converter\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // go to the position\n"
"\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // drop the titanium\n"
"\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5);              // step back 2.5 m\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::CollectTitanium1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// 1) Definición de variables.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a>  item;            // información sobre objetos\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 2) Ir al mineral de titanio y agarrarlo.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>TitaniumOre</a>);// buscar mineral de titanio\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // ir a la posición\n"
"\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // agarrar el titanio\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 3) Ir al convertidor y soltarlo.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Converter</a>); // buscar convertidor\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // ir a la posición\n"
"\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // soltar el titanio\n"
"\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5);              // retroceder 2.5 m\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/5_CollectTitanium2.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below is one of the programs that has been developed by our engineers.\n"
"An upgrade on the previous program: the <a object|botgr>grabber</a>, on its way back from the converter, makes a stop, if necessary, at the <a object|station>power station</a> to recharge its power cell."
msgstr ""
"A continuación se muestra uno de los programas desarrollados por nuestros ingenieros.\n"
"Una mejora del programa anterior: el <a object|botgr>bot agarrador</a>, en su camino de regreso del convertidor, hace una parada, si es necesario, en la <a object|station>estación de energía</a> para recargar su celda de energía."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/5_CollectTitanium2.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "This program also works on <a object|botgj>winged grabbers</a>, if the <a object|derrick>derrick</a> is on another island than the <a object|convert>converter</a>."
msgstr "Este programa también funciona en <a object|botgj>bots agarradores alados</a>, si la <a object|derrick>torre de perforación</a> está en otra isla que el <a object|convert>convertidor</a>."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/5_CollectTitanium2.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::CollectTitanium2()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// 1) Variable definition.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a>  item;            // info. about objects\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 2) Go to the titanium ore and grab it.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>TitaniumOre</a>);// look for titanium ore\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // go to the position\n"
"\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // grab the titanium\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 3) Go to the converter and drop it.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Converter</a>); // look for converter\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // go to the position\n"
"\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // drop the titanium\n"
"\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5);              // step back 2.5 m\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t// 4) If power cell half empty, recharges.\n"
"\tif ( energyCell.energyLevel < 0.5 )\n"
"\t{                               // if so:\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>); // look for station\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);        // go there\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(5);                    // wait\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::CollectTitanium2()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// 1) Definición de variables.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a>  item;            // información sobre objetos\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 2) Ir al mineral de titanio y agarrarlo.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>TitaniumOre</a>);// buscar mineral de titanio\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // ir a la posición\n"
"\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // agarrar el titanio\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 3) Ir al convertidor y soltarlo.\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Converter</a>); // buscar convertidor\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // ir a la posición\n"
"\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // soltar el titanio\n"
"\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5);              // retroceder 2.5 m\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t// 4) Si la celda está medio vacía, recarga.\n"
"\tif ( energyCell.energyLevel < 0.5 )\n"
"\t{                               // si es así:\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>); // buscar estación\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);        // ir allí\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(5);                    // esperar\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/6_KillAnt1.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the program <code>KillAnt1</code> immediately on your <a object|botfr>wheeled shooter</a>, it will protect your west flank. Meantime you can elaborate your defense strategy."
msgstr "Ejecuta el programa <code>KillAnt1</code> inmediatamente en tu <a object|botfr>bot tirador con ruedas</a>, protegerá tu flanco oeste. Mientras tanto puedes elaborar tu estrategia de defensa."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/6_KillAnt1.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::KillAnt1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;             // info. about object\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(-30, 0);            // go west\n"
"\t<a cbot|aim>aim</a>(0);                  // aim straight\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( true )           // repeat forever:\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>AlienAnt</a>, 0, 360, 0, 40);\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|if>if</a> ( item != null )  // ant detected ?\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|turn>turn</a>(<a cbot|direct>direction</a>(item.position));\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|fire>fire</a>(0.5);       // shoot 0.5 s\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);             // wait 1 second\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::KillAnt1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;             // información sobre objeto\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(-30, 0);            // ir al oeste\n"
"\t<a cbot|aim>aim</a>(0);                  // apuntar recto\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( true )           // repetir siempre:\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>AlienAnt</a>, 0, 360, 0, 40);\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|if>if</a> ( item != null )  // ¿hormiga detectada?\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|turn>turn</a>(<a cbot|direct>direction</a>(item.position));\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|fire>fire</a>(0.5);       // disparar 0.5 s\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);             // esperar 1 segundo\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/7_CollectTitanium3.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "As you will need lots of titanium for this mission, we have made the program <code>CollectTitanium</code> still more efficient. It gathers a whole series of titanium cubes on a free surface, so you can let it work on its own. It also recharges itself at the <a object|station>power station</a> if necessary."
msgstr "Como necesitarás mucho titanio para esta misión, hemos hecho el programa <code>CollectTitanium</code> aún más eficiente. Recoge toda una serie de cubos de titanio en una superficie libre, para que puedas dejarlo trabajar solo. También se recarga en la <a object|station>estación de energía</a> si es necesario."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/7_CollectTitanium3.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::CollectTitanium3()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// 1) Variable definition.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a>  item;            // info. about objects\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> (true)             // repeat forever\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 2) Go to the titanium ore and grab it.\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>TitaniumOre</a>);// look for titanium\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // go to the position\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // grab the titanium\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 3) Go to the converter and drop it.\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Converter</a>); // look for converter\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // go to the position\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // drop the titanium\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5);              // step back 2.5 m\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 4) Wait until titanium converted and grab it\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|do>do</a>\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);              // wait for cube\n"
"\t\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Titanium</a>, 0, 45, 0, 5);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( item == null );\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                   // grab it\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 5) Drop on a free space\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(<a cbot|space>space</a>(position));    // go to free space\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                   // drop titanium\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 6) If power cell half empty, recharges.\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|if>if</a> ( energyCell.energyLevel < 0.5 )\n"
"\t\t{                         // if so:\n"
"\t\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>);\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|if>if</a> ( item != null )   // station found ?\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position); // go there\n"
"\t\t\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( energyCell.energyLevel < 1 )\n"
"\t\t\t\t{                 // until recharged:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);      // wait\n"
"\t\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::CollectTitanium3()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// 1) Definición de variables.\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a>  item;            // información sobre objetos\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> (true)             // repetir siempre\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 2) Ir al mineral de titanio y agarrarlo.\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>TitaniumOre</a>);// buscar titanio\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // ir a la posición\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // agarrar el titanio\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 3) Ir al convertidor y soltarlo.\n"
"\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Converter</a>); // buscar convertidor\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);     // ir a la posición\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // soltar el titanio\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5);              // retroceder 2.5 m\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 4) Esperar hasta que el titanio se convierta y agarrarlo\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|do>do</a>\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);              // esperar el cubo\n"
"\t\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>Titanium</a>, 0, 45, 0, 5);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( item == null );\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                   // agarrarlo\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 5) Soltar en un espacio libre\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(<a cbot|space>space</a>(position));    // ir a espacio libre\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                   // soltar titanio\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 6) Si la celda está medio vacía, recarga.\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|if>if</a> ( energyCell.energyLevel < 0.5 )\n"
"\t\t{                         // si es así:\n"
"\t\t\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(<a cbot|category>PowerStation</a>);\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|if>if</a> ( item != null )   // ¿estación encontrada?\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position); // ir allí\n"
"\t\t\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( energyCell.energyLevel < 1 )\n"
"\t\t\t\t{                 // hasta recargar:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);      // esperar\n"
"\t\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have developed a program that takes care of recharging the power cell of a <a object|tower>defense tower</a>:"
msgstr "Hemos desarrollado un programa que se encarga de recargar la celda de energía de una <a object|tower>torre de defensa</a>:"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to a <a object|tower>defense tower</a>."
msgstr "Ir a una <a object|tower>torre de defensa</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wait until the <a object|power>power cell</a> is 80% empty."
msgstr "Esperar hasta que la <a object|power>celda de energía</a> esté al 80% vacía."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grab the <a object|power>power cell</a> and recharge it on a <a object|station>power station</a>."
msgstr "Agarrar la <a object|power>celda de energía</a> y recargarla en una <a object|station>estación de energía</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Put it back on the <a object|tower>defense tower</a>."
msgstr "Colocarla de nuevo en la <a object|tower>torre de defensa</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the <a object|station>power station</a> as close as possible to the tower in order to reduce the time when the tower has got no power cell. A good trick is to place a power cell on the ground in front of the tower. The wasp will attack the power cell, and if the first shoot misses or a wasp arrives when the defense tower has got no energy, only the power cell is destroyed and not the defense tower."
msgstr "Construye la <a object|station>estación de energía</a> lo más cerca posible de la torre para reducir el tiempo en que la torre no tiene celda de energía. Un buen truco es colocar una celda de energía en el suelo frente a la torre. La avispa atacará la celda de energía, y si el primer disparo falla o una avispa llega cuando la torre de defensa no tiene energía, solo se destruirá la celda de energía y no la torre de defensa."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/8_ServiceTower1.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::ServiceTower1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|object>object</a>  tower;               // info. about tower\n"
"\t<a cbot|object>object</a>  station;             // info. about station\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 1) go to the defense tower\n"
"\ttower = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(DefenseTower); // look for tower\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(tower.position);        // go there\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( true )               // repeat forever\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// 2) wait until power cell is empty\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( tower.energyCell.energyLevel > 0.2 )\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(2);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // grab the power cell\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 3) go to the power station to recharge\n"
"\t\tstation = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(PowerStation);\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(station.position);  // go there\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( load.energyLevel < 1 )\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);             // wait until recharged\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 4) go back to defense tower\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(tower.position);    // go to tower\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // drop the power cell\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::ServiceTower1()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|object>object</a>  tower;               // información sobre torre\n"
"\t<a cbot|object>object</a>  station;             // información sobre estación\n"
"\t\n"
"\t// 1) ir a la torre de defensa\n"
"\ttower = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(DefenseTower); // buscar torre\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(tower.position);        // ir allí\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( true )               // repetir siempre\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// 2) esperar hasta que la celda esté vacía\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( tower.energyCell.energyLevel > 0.2 )\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(2);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|grab>grab</a>();                  // agarrar la celda de energía\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 3) ir a la estación de energía para recargar\n"
"\t\tstation = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(PowerStation);\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(station.position);  // ir allí\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|while>while</a> ( load.energyLevel < 1 )\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(1);             // esperar hasta recargar\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t// 4) volver a la torre de defensa\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(tower.position);    // ir a la torre\n"
"\t\t<a cbot|drop>drop</a>();                  // soltar la celda de energía\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/9_terranova.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "According to the data transmitted by the satellite, our engineers have developed two programs. The first one guides the <a object|botshld>shielder bot</a> through the narrow valley north close to the place where the key has been located. You can follow it without fearing any attack:"
msgstr "Según los datos transmitidos por el satélite, nuestros ingenieros han desarrollado dos programas. El primero guía al <a object|botshld>bot escudo</a> a través del estrecho valle del norte cerca del lugar donde se ha ubicado la llave. Puedes seguirlo sin temer ningún ataque:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/9_terranova.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Outward()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(1,15);   // activate the shield\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(6,160);    // go close to the key\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(0,15);   // deactivate the shield\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Outward()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(1,15);   // activar el escudo\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(6,160);    // ir cerca de la llave\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(0,15);   // desactivar el escudo\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/9_terranova.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "The second program guides the <a object|botshld>shielder bot</a> back to the <a object|base>spaceship</a>:"
msgstr "El segundo programa guía al <a object|botshld>bot escudo</a> de regreso a la <a object|base>nave espacial</a>:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/9_terranova.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Return()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(1,15);   // activate the shield\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(8,60);     // go to the spaceship\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(0,15);   // deactivate the shield\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Return()\n"
"{\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(1,15);   // activar el escudo\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(8,60);     // ir a la nave espacial\n"
"\t<a cbot|shield>shield</a>(0,15);   // desactivar el escudo\n"
"}"
